      "note": "A committed batch carrying one accepted and one rejected claim result. ADR-007 prohibits partial acceptance and until PF-070 nothing but prose did: the batch result was one map with a batch outcome and an independent per-claim outcome, tied to each other by nothing. These are the bytes of the instance that was valid."
