      "expected": "reject",
      "reason_code": "challenge-expected-tuple-absent",
      "registry_reason_code": "CLAIM_CHALLENGE_ALREADY_USED",
      "note": "The exact shape SR-007 named: a challenge with no expected next sequence, no expected local head and no expected checkpoint. It is what claim_challenges stored and what ClaimChallenge published, while VIBEPROOF_V1_PROTOCOL.md said the server verifies that tuple. The grammar now refuses it, so the two artifacts cannot drift back to it without this case failing."
    },
    {
      "id": "challenge-max-batch-claims-above-batch-context",
