      "reason_code": "challenge-max-batch-claims-unencodable",
      "registry_reason_code": "CLAIM_CHALLENGE_ALREADY_USED",
      "note": "A challenge authorizing 300 claims. batch-context label 4 admits at most 256, so the label was uint32 against a container bounded at 256 and a challenge could authorize a batch that could not be encoded."
